# Apex Automata — Cursor rules moved

This legacy file is superseded (2026-09-10). Cursor now loads project rules from `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`:

- `00-apex-core.mdc` — always on: phase, repo map, commands, non-negotiables
- `10-live-money-safety.mdc` — trading/, exchanges/, api/, config/
- `30-supabase-persistence.mdc` — supabase/, persistence/
- `40-backtest-research-integrity.mdc` — backtesting/, strategies/, docs/research/
- `50-dashboard-ui.mdc` — src/
- `60-coinbase-advanced-trade.mdc` — Coinbase API facts (agent-requested)

Skills: `.cursor/skills/` · Subagents: `.cursor/agents/` · Commands: `.cursor/commands/` · MCP: `.cursor/mcp.json`
Current plan: `docs/plans/SPRINT-9-LIVE-COINBASE.md` · Task queue: `CURSOR_TASKS/`
